{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18320","headline":"广宣上人以诗贺放榜和谢 · 王涯","name":"广宣上人以诗贺放榜和谢","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"延英面奉入春闱，亦选功夫亦选奇。\n在冶只求金不耗，用心空学秤无私。\n龙门变化人皆望，莺谷飞鸣自有时。\n独喜至公谁是证，弥天上人与新诗。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王涯","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18320.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18320","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}